{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S08-S10等短停留段的小字感受仍然偏密，观众可能来不及逐条消化；Y的双栏叙事更容易快速读完。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"平\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X虽然信息更多，但话语中的高亮重点能帮助我迅速抓住人物当下的矛盾，小字感受又按音乐段落出现，不必一次读完。尤其是「被当作自己人」这条线，从短暂高兴、怀念、害怕孤单，到最后愿意带着想念继续生活，人物心理前后扣得很紧；音乐中的舞步、旧歌、摇篮曲、旋律碎片和力度变化也提供了具体而细腻的情绪依据。Y的叙事更顺畅易读，但部分关键动机被概括，音乐感受也损失了不少层次和前后变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ebd79f51-e765-4261-9068-635abb2b3bfb", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T001248796828Z", "elapsed_seconds": 100.469, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:14:29.283272+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "409d95f6488b05e26b1b8dc25445f549ad57792473f72d3331ae408df997f0bc", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\